# Game Design: Simple Adventure Game

## Game Overview
A simple text-based adventure game where players navigate through a fantasy world, making choices to progress through the game. The game will feature a variety of environments, characters, and challenges.

## Game Mechanics

* The game will be text-based, with players inputting commands to navigate and interact with the environment.
* Players will be able to choose from a list of actions, such as moving north, south, east, or west, or interacting with objects or characters.
* The game will keep track of the player's progress, including their current location and any items they may have collected.

