* The game will be run from the command line, with text-based input and output.
* The game will display the current location, any items the player has collected, and any challenges or obstacles to overcome.
* The game will respond to the player's input with a description of the consequences of their actions.

## Features

* Multiple locations to explore, each with unique challenges and opportunities.
* A variety of items to collect, each with its own properties and uses.
* A day/night cycle, with different challenges and opportunities at different times of day.

