**Game Design Document**
=======================

**Game Name:** "Quest for the Ancient Relic"

**Game Overview:**
-----------------

"Quest for the Ancient Relic" is a text-based adventure game where players navigate through a fantasy world, complete quests, and engage in battles to retrieve the fabled Ancient Relic. The game will feature a rich storyline, character development, and challenging combat mechanics.

**Game Structure:**
------------------

The game will be structured around the following main components:

