# Maze Game Design Document

## Overview

Maze Game is a simple text-based game written in Python. The game is set in a fantasy world where the user must navigate through a maze to reach the treasure at the center.

## Architecture

The game will be built using object-oriented programming principles, with the following classes:

*   `Game`: This class will contain the main game loop and will be responsible for managing the user's input and the game state.
*   `Maze`: This class will represent the maze and will contain methods for moving the user and the treasure.
*   `Player`: This class will represent the user and will contain methods for getting and setting the user's location.

## User Interface

The game will be a text-based interface where the user will input their moves and the game will display the current state of the maze.

